@startuml

salt
{
  <b>DECIDE A CONVENTION CHANGE</b>  { Queue | Request | Decision | Decided }
  --
  {
    {
      <b>1. Requests waiting for Market Risk</b>
      --
      {#
        Request | Asked by | Kind | Waiting
        Change AED swap day count | m.okafor | swap | 2 days
        New set: Dubai swaps desk | j.ruiz | set | 1 day
        Retire AED-EIBOR-6M-SWAP | m.okafor | swap | 4 hours
      }
      <i>Requests that you raised are not in this list.</i>
      [ Open the first ]
    } | {
      <b>2. The change</b>  -  swap, party ACCOUS
      --
      {#
        Term | Now | Asked for
        Fixed Day Count | 30/360 | <b>ACT/360</b>
        Fixed Calendar | AED | AED
        Index | AED-EIBOR-6M | AED-EIBOR-6M
      }
      Reason given: the AED swaps are booked on the wrong basis.
      --
      <b>Reach</b>  every definition of ACCOUS reads this row
      Rule: 1 approval from Market Risk. The asker cannot decide.
      [ Back ] | [ Decide ]
    }
  }
  --
  {
    {
      <b>3. Decide</b>
      --
      Comment: ^ACT/360 is the Dubai market basis.^
      ( ) Approve
      ( ) Decline
      ( ) Hold
      <i>A decline needs a comment.</i>
      [ Back ] | [ Send the decision ]
    } | {
      <b>4. Decided</b>
      --
      <b>Approved by t.brandt at 2026-10-19 11:02</b>
      The change applies when the last approval arrives.
      <b>Nothing applies it today: no convention request kind exists.</b>
      [ Back to the queue ]
    }
  }
}

@enduml
